## 🛠️ Hardware Per Junction (Cost: ~₹18,000–25,000/junction)

| Component | Spec | Cost (INR) |
|---|---|---|
| Edge Controller | Raspberry Pi 5 / Jetson Nano | ₹8,000 |
| Vehicle Detector | Inductive loop OR camera | ₹5,000–12,000 |
| 5G/4G Module | SIM7600 or similar | ₹2,500 |
| Signal Interface | Relay board (connects to existing signal) | ₹800 |
| Solar + UPS | Backup power | ₹3,500 |
| **Total** | per junction | **~₹20,000** |

> **Pune has 900 signalled junctions** → full-city deployment cost ≈ **₹1.8 Cr**  
> **Annual savings in fuel + time** for a city of Pune's size ≈ **₹280+ Cr/yr**  
> **ROI: < 3 weeks**

