## 📦 Tech Stack Summary (for Technical Judges)

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Simulation | SUMO 1.20 + TraCI | Industry-standard microsimulation |
| Backend | FastAPI + asyncio | Non-blocking WebSocket stream |
| AI Brain | GATConv GNN + Double-DQN | Captures spatial relationships + temporal decisions |
| Graph Building | OSMnx + networkX | Real city topologies from OpenStreetMap |
| Frontend | React + Vite + Mapbox GL | Real-time 3D city visualization |
| Emergency | TraCI vehicle API + position tracking | Continuous per-step green wave |
| Comparison | REST metrics store + 3-mode snapshot | Quantified IRL benchmark |
